---
---
<section class="protocol-section not-content">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="hdr">
      <div class="kicker"><span class="bar"></span><span>04 THE PROTOCOL</span></div>
      <h2>Boring on purpose. You can read every byte that crosses.</h2>
      <p>
        One envelope type. One frame enum. wincode layout, bincode-2 standard. No TLVs,
        no magic, no reflection. The Kotlin and Swift codecs are called Bincode because
        the bytes have not changed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pipe">
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="lbl">01 SOURCE</span>
        <h4>Rust plugin</h4>
        <code>#[istmo::plugin]<br/>async fn echo(…)</code>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow"></span>
      <div class="stage sand">
        <span class="lbl">02 ENCODE</span>
        <h4>wincode</h4>
        <code>payload bytes<br/>varint u32 tags</code>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow"></span>
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="lbl">03 FRAME</span>
        <h4>Envelope</h4>
        <code>Frame::Call &#123; … &#125;<br/>PROTOCOL_VERSION = 4</code>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow"></span>
      <div class="stage sand">
        <span class="lbl">04 BRIDGE</span>
        <h4>FFI</h4>
        <code>JNI typed call<br/>C ABI callbacks</code>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow"></span>
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="lbl">05 DECODE</span>
        <h4>Native codec</h4>
        <code>Bincode.readString<br/>Bincode.writeString</code>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="details">
      <div>
        <h5>ENVELOPE TYPE</h5>
        <p>Four variants: Call, Respond, Notify, Event. Routed on CallId.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>STREAMS</h5>
        <p>Frame::Event per item, Frame::StreamEnd &#123; Complete | Error &#125; on close.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>CANCELLATION</h5>
        <p>Cooperative CancelToken, flume bounded(1), drop-sender-on-cancel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.protocol-section { padding: 5rem 0; }
.protocol-section .inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
.protocol-section .hdr { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
.protocol-section .kicker {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem;
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.protocol-section .kicker .bar { width: 1.5rem; height: 2px; background: #bfff00; }
.protocol-section h2 {
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
  line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); font-weight: 700;
}
.protocol-section .hdr p {
  font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); max-width: 50rem; margin: 0;
}
.protocol-section .pipe {
  display: flex; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 3rem; overflow-x: auto;
}
.protocol-section .stage {
  flex: 1 1 11rem; min-width: 11rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 0.75rem;
  padding: 1.25rem; background: var(--sl-color-bg);
}
.protocol-section .stage.sand {
  background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
  border-color: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
}
.protocol-section .stage .lbl {
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.09em; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: block;
}
.protocol-section .stage h4 {
  margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  font-weight: 600; color: var(--sl-color-white);
}
.protocol-section .stage code {
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
  line-height: 1.55; display: block; background: none; padding: 0;
}
.protocol-section .arrow {
  flex: 0 0 2rem; align-self: center; height: 1px;
  background: var(--sl-color-gray-5);
}
.protocol-section .details {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem;
}
@media (max-width: 55rem) {
  .protocol-section .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
}
.protocol-section .details h5 {
  font-family: var(--sl-font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.09em; color: #0a6b2e; margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;
}
:root[data-theme='dark'] .protocol-section .details h5 { color: #bfff00; }
.protocol-section .details p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
</style>
